              <div class="spec-dl__row">
                <dt>TOOLS</dt>
                <dd>Soft sponge · Warm water · Mild soap (interior only)</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-dl__row">
                <dt>FORBIDDEN</dt>
                <dd>Abrasive pads · Dishwasher · Prolonged soaking of base</dd>
